Subject: [PATCH 42/43] =?UTF-8?q?Importar=20FamiTracker:=20tabelas=20de=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?afina=C3=A7=C3=A3o=20do=200CC=20(DETUNETABLES)=20viram=20afina?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=C3=A7=C3=A3o=20da=20m=C3=BAsica=20e=20transposi=C3=A7=C3=A3o?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20por=20chip;=20log=20dos=20efeitos=20sem=20equivalente?=
